{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "source_mode": "sha256-utf8",
  "resource": "MC2Game/Localization/Coalesced.int",
  "input_sha256": "179e265cfc9e6d3e9f2586abe75b5da303b2af9b8484079851dab72f9f7edb8c",
  "entries": [
    {
      "id": "coalesced:abf7baadc33a2808cc5396f54ba7395a4dc251490990a59103106b5b053bf77d",
      "source_sha256": "b25cd0df2e5c7df64c18064888a3fceda83f7c0bfd6a6b210ca83c22d99e9ef1",
      "translation": "试着让塞蕾丝汀逗露开心吧"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:0fd3e1aacef3fdcf0af93f2cac10e6dd7b1c60b3a13eb80706609d1567a91fa2",
      "source_sha256": "7781506df6c68d1d0649989ee82707e206b53ddd16988c523b1ea5e0a465f249",
      "translation": "石头的微笑"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:e1db41cda8be2d4c2aa0e60dda87bd6e35a276a1d8d2404d770bfc7e108bc010",
      "source_sha256": "2687934b4179603ac2e66d4ee7633cf01b704fa4c1b26b363b0781b9380585c5",
      "translation": "塞蕾丝汀姐姐，去哪儿了呢……"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:68ebf92270fe864b3d7f8d8717fd7fc054fb7a44adc4ef7ddb0efcdd638ec9ce",
      "source_sha256": "49c3e0a61ca086d42e9e2ab3cadc99527b6dfa7ef7b217c6641a445154dfbd83",
      "translation": "啊，塞蕾丝汀姐姐。和姐姐同行的人里，有个叫[露]的人吧。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:2429369be50f027d4fd938e0f7dc5f9a2a28a9e0bb0ea8024bddc0963f4f8b2b",
      "source_sha256": "45b46fa7f3ea37956062838f625113af249f973f2a87a9b17096c1effd8d5107",
      "translation": "她一直都那么冷淡吗？"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:a33b3eca536543148b323e3215ef1dbe9c0747ced7fad910f5b36639a18ce2bc",
      "source_sha256": "72e1f66b82615e14845cc04a11184d4f37a027d4aca9e8b008d462b1929bd03c",
      "translation": "我想和她亲近些，就送了她礼物，可她却说“不需要”，拒绝了我。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:804e724115ae624db0dc70886e0a104a180013f7b5a84bc2632930005e99adee",
      "source_sha256": "4a0c494922bbde9ac1d5ba64bc5dbfce189aa6bf2849fbe2b185221f94acabbd",
      "translation": "她是不是讨厌我啊？"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:b7de05c13a1a9c1d90caa892a3504f03dc08e4b912f11f7e13f6822ff62dd3db",
      "source_sha256": "2e85ab34a81e2c1dac70764d9c61025e4a034ca5f0df07402e73e00730000d51",
      "translation": "公主的传闻，我也听说了，可日子总得过。买点东西吧。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:234b5608025da11dce04feb0b24338bfac8c5be3590457f0a553c774ae0247e8",
      "source_sha256": "768bba0da3e8a9cc8a0b3ea042a63a1ebb910e389950cf48e65c332616df365d",
      "translation": "嗯……休息站还在正常营业。不会因为你们和公主是一伙的，就把你们赶走。虽然，我还是希望你们能早点离开。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 2,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:0b27954331a4ad751748b4853fdcd1e437a6b3feff15afcdc77144f79c48b554",
      "source_sha256": "34169ced954f4742ff76e30579afecf23c38402c9e4e941c1ad5b10012a9aa3e",
      "translation": "你们就是那伙臭名昭著的公主同党？哼，赶紧滚吧！",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:dcec0edf286978e7b371090d858b2583571cb8d78fa424c56665d6b4b7a8accb",
      "source_sha256": "bfb69502fbf4873ad26402feb6949f27e9eb69d73446ed3398f0bd07072a4ccb",
      "translation": "听说南部军和北部军正在休战，我也打算离开这里，出去旅行了。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 2,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:ae759d3ac0a56aac0a0b79b3b84c77a9a8ff1d466da846f844bf6f7d04f5794c",
      "source_sha256": "a2e5d370e5b674da126c40ed3b3c088a0f36ce2e1e3be8e1ab58c790e4776125",
      "translation": "阿维斯运输队扩大了业务，出行应该会方便得多吧。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:0a18aead5f840a58baefb901df97b82b75b3d15fc55b334bcb0a4fc6d01283c7",
      "source_sha256": "1dfa508f06a9b7edaa04b4cc7621f5915cf4e0c5359763b4714476d4d9f1204a",
      "translation": "因为战争，平原这条路上，已经没什么人来了……都是你们害的。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 2,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:66c59270dd4ad034b029834b0ad31d2d5613386d9dd16593b96efb1bb53840c6",
      "source_sha256": "339a8a49d0e2a692f1a866c066fbb0d8761446ca85e1b40450aa95dc164f5399",
      "translation": "不过嘛……你们帮忙打倒了盗贼，这件事，我还是很感激的。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 2,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:f8c09e1f818d0d7e1278b1b0d8fdab40eb05163ee8859731b84824fa24577a95",
      "source_sha256": "638e50704667b06468780de4e5a821b2ee4d568226c394751938ebdffb7bd23b",
      "translation": "住在阿巴泽特的同胞，还在打仗吗喵？",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:bd670d265a6a050ae642069c69228298a4823121863b19638a482f8161f5eb41",
      "source_sha256": "826c8acca51fd13689ac65672c1b1d1154a452c111bf4578451ec14e0ed27331",
      "translation": "我听说，人类那边已经休战了喵。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:43cff53b8a17a86cf29d6a5261eee719f4365f453261e086a02699ead4d8e3d0",
      "source_sha256": "a0aa1fc0d18355f6a8183d99677b6613feed4c0e5bd6e34160acfc3e4f649a0f",
      "translation": "最近胖了，得减肥了喵～",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:55f6d02fc69b6fad24114a7033ea9fcff5125f7a5d5fe45557abf0da5bc63dcd",
      "source_sha256": "84dc779ae5a0bc39f874efd7c06a622b6173931bd9c7285ca9ccee6e40a47cbb",
      "translation": "人类之间流传着，公主是恶魔的传闻喵。是真的吗喵？",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 2,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:fef21dc1ff2994286150b18ef5154ec18a110969a3863d3b03c988ae209a1f1b",
      "source_sha256": "bbc0b7593a2bde202da5ce80232ecc719b854aa7172f32224fae92ab74d66c5b",
      "translation": "马雷族的成年礼，顺利举行了吗喵？"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:56074f4dc56b5aa5685e1e71fe17e5cd84dd0acee2413c6c81d4ff45c7567192",
      "source_sha256": "702fceafbcce5338d87d22ee7f1c3292af90ec03dee38f136fda91830a0ec2bd",
      "translation": "休息站老板"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:538c45ef008425cfdff981cf70573ca076b42c4ef887ca1ca86492e0c934f063",
      "source_sha256": "5885b1561e7a5fa21c6570038d1230614e738bc5b2d5e93104afb3f1a9488611",
      "translation": "休息站管理员"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:5ca4e181541703277ef1ec2315ab20198ac62127f4eb46409a7142309f7b7eb4",
      "source_sha256": "8aad0aef0939057b767b9f067c5dcba85cdaa6854b2e15b164e4cfc8aa969698",
      "translation": "休息站客人"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:54697fa5e4f6586cbef28507fdb32468f4f8a286cc4d975a8715372dc038ee34",
      "source_sha256": "526c5c08e617f01d83abbb1bca3d40bf106006b68cc96830e8357a104fea9d90",
      "translation": "休息站"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:b1c15c241280855ed8409fb4f01b96faa05043622610e0ee6c0e4ad3b9ed1823",
      "source_sha256": "e3d76db75403cf7f4d899cb6bfd09c2768047b3dec85a8c4d22b8f30526a0eb3",
      "translation": "因故暂停前往的地点"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:49dcecf1ff4160dd75d80d2e38daea8de5ee6cbb0b82725a7c75528da42ba271",
      "source_sha256": "2f3449720c4540a3d488cad224c19960a97ce7a6bb54b5be6abbf7cb44316b07",
      "translation": "各位好，这里是阿维斯运输队。\\n近日，南部军与北部军对部分地区实施管制，\\n因此，有些地点已经暂停前往。\\n\\n我们将停止前往[阿巴泽特草原]、[老狐峡谷临时营地]、\\n[杜南丘陵黑刃要塞]的运输服务。\\n\\n另外，[鲁哈尔特盆地]的运输队已经迁移，\\n现在位于连接杜南平原的晶柱附近。\\n请各位使用阿维斯运输队时，留意上述变动。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:5ab816a5046ae2f82969949e2a1c577566a29df1909b646e5b94e9a76f06e474",
      "source_sha256": "eebe940e6071e713b4fc23e115c6da1547840da7e863a8b317a647c68bd2d54c",
      "translation": "新增目的地"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:639a0a05bfdc1e108249a5853f9e5f32e76fc098e6a1a0e184145c1ff10bc1b3",
      "source_sha256": "bcba5a6a807e6e4cef9a64664742bcdd047bbcee6556265dcdc3c46efa36bbac",
      "translation": "各位好，这里是阿维斯运输队。\\n这次来信，是为了通知新开通的目的地。\\n\\n我们新增了[星光平原]、[贝尔福特]，\\n作为阿维斯运输队的站点。\\n由于南部军与北部军处于休战状态，\\n贝尔福特反而成了安全的地方，因此得以开通线路。\\n阿维斯运输队会继续努力，\\n为各位提供更多服务。"
    }
  ]
}
